<p id="A1.F12.7.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F12.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:80%;width:85.4pt;">LSUN Horse</span></p>
